# Local development defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8000 when this is absent.
# On Vercel, set this in Project Settings -> Environment Variables, then redeploy.
# Server-only runtime setting. Do not use NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL.
# Use your real public Python backend origin, without /api or a trailing path.
# An unconfigured Vercel app builds, but API calls return a JSON 503 setup message.
# BACKEND_URL=https://your-python-backend.example.com
